tive to the calendar.\n\n**Fix:** Reschedule using `setTimeout` to the *next intended wall-clock time* (e.g., next midnight), recalculating after each run:\n\n```javascript\nfunction scheduleJob() {\n  const now = new Date();\n  const tomorrow = new Date(now);\n  tomorrow.setDate(tomorrow.getDate() + 1);\n  tomorrow.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0); // midnight tomorrow\n  \n  const delayMs = tomorrow - now;\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    run();\n    scheduleJob(); // reschedule for next midnight\n  }, delayMs);\n}\n\nscheduleJob();\n```\n\nEach iteration recalculates the delay to the next midnight *from the current wall-clock time*, so DST changes don't accumulate drift—the job stays anchored to calendar time, not elapsed time.","ttft_ms":7082,"type":"result","duration_ms":9530,"uuid":"ba5ac869-4dd2-46d1-a89a-c385f89d2c4e","ttft_stream_ms":815,"time_to_request_ms":130,"first_content_frame_ms":815,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":894,"cacheReadInputTokens":7770,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0052569999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":587,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-12T05:14:51.381Z"}